{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar","id":620803,"title":"Interview with a Solar","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-08T19:15:43-07:00","id":620803,"title":"Interview with a Solar","content":"<i>From the desk of Strider of the Northern Sky, Joybringer and Head of the Division of Serenity:</i><br /> <i>Contained herein is the transcript of my interview with the Zenith Caste Solar, Sesus Rai.</i><br /> <br /> Strider: Alright, shall we begin?<br /> <br /> Rai: It\u2019s as good a time as any.<br /> <br /> S: Alright then, You are Rai of House Sesus, son of Sesus Soral and Zenith caste Solar. Correct?<br /> <br /> R: I am, yes. That hasn\u2019t changed in the past ten minutes.<br /> <br /> S: (laughs) Sorry, standard questions. So if you\u2019re a Dynast, why did I find you in Great Forks?<br /> <br /> R: Well I\u2019m a Solar, It shouldn\u2019t be surprising I\u2019m not sitting pretty on the Blessed Isle. That said, I\u2019d been outside the Realm for some time before that\u2026 it\u2019s a long story.<br /> <br /> S: Right. So I was at a loss of questions to ask, so I discreetly allowed some others to submit some. If you don\u2019t mind answering, I\u2019ll put them to you.<br /> <br /> R: Works for me.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">So then, I'm working on this Character for an EX3 game I'm planning to run and while I have a good sense of what he's like, I want to nail down his place in and views on the world. Instead of just sitting down and thinking real hard about what questions, I decided it might be more fun to put it here and answer your questions. Meta questions are fine and will be answered in a self-aware, fourth-wall breaking manner, but all other questions will be answered without Meta knowledge. So... yeah, fire away. And thank you for reading!<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T20:17:18-07:00","id":620852,"title":"","content":"How do you decide who to save and who to kill?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T20:27:08-07:00","id":620875,"title":"","content":"How did you Exalt?<br /> <br /> Does your family know that you're a Solar? If so, how did you survive them? Are they still hunting you?<br /> <br /> Do you worship the Unconquered Sun? Why or why not?<br /> <br /> Are you, on the whole, glad that you Exalted as a Solar?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T20:29:53-07:00","id":620877,"title":"","content":"What do you view as the most important factors in need of change in Creation?<br /> <br /> Do you intend to do anything to change these factors, and if so how?<br /> <br /> How do you view your relationship with your Patron, the Unconquered Sun?<br /> <br /> What do you think is the proper roll of heaven and the gods in Creation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T21:21:37-07:00","id":620899,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=620852#post620852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How do you decide who to save and who to kill?</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought you started with the easy questions. To be honest it's mostly a case by case basis. I protect the people I care about, but I try to avoid killing needlessly. I have my goals, though, and will kill to realize them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wardragon</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">How did you Exalt?</div> </div> </div> </div>I exalted when I was traveling back to Great Forks from a personal trip. One day on the roads I encountered a pair of Immaculate Monks, one an elder and the other a trainee. They were both wounded and the elder was a dead woman walking. I offered them some help and inquired what exactly they were doing that far from the Isle. They told me they were part of a Wyld hunt called to respond to some Anathema activity. Before they could explain much more, &quot;Anathema Activity&quot; found us, It was a group of undead, somehow able to survive the sunlight. Part of the forces of the Walker in Darkness, according to the monks. We squared off with them, the three of us versus some dozen odd corpses. The younger monk and I killed two in the time it took for the elder to cut through six. We may have won, had the leader of the undead not shown up. He was one of the Forsaken, or as I know them know, a Dusk Caste Abyssal. He made his entrance by plunging his sword into the elder monk's heart. As she lay bleeding out on the ground, he took the time to look us over. It was like staring death itself in the face. every instinct told me to run, the young monk lost his nerve and collapsed in a heap next to me. The horrified look on his face was one I'd seen before, and I realized I had no choice but to face our enemy both for him and the last person i saw with that look. As i made that decision, the moon rose to block out the sun, and I was exalted by the Unconquered Sun. I cut down the remaining undead, and dueled the Abyssal to the death. He lost, and the monk and I managed to escape.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Does your family know that you're a Solar? If so, how did you survive them? Are they still hunting you? </div> </div> </div>My family does not know, or at least I don't know if they do. They had been chasing me for two years before then for different reasons, but I survived with a lot of luck and some supernatural help. They haven't sent an assassin in a while, which if I had to guess is because the secrets I may have had on them are very out of date by now. or they just need a good exuse to send a Dragonblood this time.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you worship the Unconquered Sun? Why or why not? </div> </div> </div>I don't worship the Unconquered Sun, because I find it hard to worship someone I could feasibly meet. Also, the closest thing to a 'God' in a religious sense I had growing up was my Dragonblooded relatives, which have never really been my Idols.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you, on the whole, glad that you Exalted as a Solar? </div> </div> </div>Yes, it gives me a chance to make the world a more righteous place, and to atone for the things I've done in the past.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T21:36:31-07:00","id":620901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=620877#post620877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What do you view as the most important factors in need of change in Creation?</div> </div> </div> </div>The fact that there are undead and the fair folk just waiting to prey on us. Important to fixing that is the fact that most of the exalts in the world need to get their heads out of their asses.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you intend to do anything to change these factors, and if so how? </div> </div> </div>I do, with the help of the circle I'm part of, we intend to wake up some other Celestials and Dragonbloods to the outside threat of the Deathlords. We intend to do this by showing we can beat them, and are currently working to destroy the Walker in Darkness.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> How do you view your relationship with your Patron, the Unconquered Sun? </div> </div> </div>I owe him for the chance to make a difference in the world, and a reason to fight on in life, but beyond that... I'm not sure.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you think is the proper role of heaven and the gods in Creation? </div> </div> </div>Hmm... I think if heaven and the Celestial Bureaucracy got their shit together, it would be easier for the Exalted Host to work against outside threats and improve the quality of life in both heaven and Creation. And for the record, I do know that us Exalts all need to get out shit together too, perhaps even more than heaven does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T22:15:49-07:00","id":620917,"title":"","content":"What's your favorite Ability, and why is it Resistance?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Solar Kitten","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3907-aretii","name":"Aretii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T22:31:21-07:00","id":620923,"title":"","content":"Do you have any vices?<br /> <br /> Is there a family member you would like to meet again?<br /> <br /> If yes, how do you think that meeting would go?<br /> <br /> How did you meet your circle?<br /> <br /> Do you have a best friend? Who is it, and what do you like about them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7103-owill0w","name":"Owill0w","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T23:27:49-07:00","id":620939,"title":"","content":"Have you ever genuinely been in love? How did that pan out?<br /> <br /> Is there someone you despise more than anyone else? If so, why?<br /> <br /> Are you truly loyal to someone or something? If so, why does this person, thing or idea command your trust?<br /> <br /> What are you <i>really</i> afraid of?<br /> <br /> If you knew for a fact that a complete stranger would die unless you sacrificed yourself to save them, would you do it? Keep in mind, you have no idea who this person is, what they have done up to now, what they would do with the life they're given, or how long they have to live in any event.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T23:53:38-07:00","id":620953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aretii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=620917#post620917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's your favorite Ability, and why is it Resistance?</div> </div> </div> </div>*Laughs* Because I had some issues with a young Lunar once, and seeing the look on his face when I took a punch and stayed standing is only second to the look he had when he realized I'd exalted as a Solar. He got his ass kicked after that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Owill0w</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you have any vices?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nothing major, some bad experiences with... unruly family members tend to turn you off those kinds of things. That and a very insistent woman *laughs*.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is there a family member you would like to meet again? </div> </div> </div>My mother and my sister, to apologize for everything. Among the living, my cousin Shu, who I used to play strategy games with as a kid.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If yes, how do you think that meeting would go? </div> </div> </div>Poorly, seeing as he's a Legionnaire these days. It could only go well if I never tell him I'm a Solar.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> How did you meet your circle? </div> </div> </div>This one's complicated... the abridged version is that I was supposed to marry a patrician girl from House Nellens for political reasons. However, during a trip back to my family's estate we were attacked by assassins. At the end of the confusion I found her kneeling over the body of one of my guards who had turned traitor. Standing over her was a shining silver woman. They both looked to me when I approached. One looked panicked, the other amused. I eventually managed to tell the Nellens girl that we needed to run, and we fled the Isle, somehow. We traveled east and managed to find a pair of other Lunars who would take her in. She took the name Crimson Lotus, and was made a Full Moon. The pair of Lunars were the Full Moon Shara leader and elder of about 250 years, and Invisible Courtier (who we call Corty), a Changing Moon who exalted three years prior. I was an informant for them in the beginning as I wandered the Scavenger Lands. Two years later, a Solar Eclipse happened and I exalted I joined them myself. a few weeks after that Corty, who had been away at the time, returned to us with his Solar mate, an Night Caste by the name of Skylas in tow. And now the five of us work together against the local Deathlords. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you have a best friend? Who is it, and what do you like about them? </div> </div> </div>I do. That would be Skylas, the circle's Night caste. It's nice to have someone around to give a different perspective on things. He was a gutter rat growing up and understand the needs of the common folk far better than I ever did, and as such isn't afraid to call me out when I do something stupid. We've reached a surprisingly deep respect considering that our first instinct on meeting was to try and kill each other. We realized that it was because the last 'him' was the one who killed the last 'me' in the past, but we managed to get over it as that was 'their' problem and 'we' refused to be tied down by it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T00:05:21-07:00","id":620957,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=620939#post620939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have you ever genuinely been in love? How did that pan out?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes! with my Lunar mate, Crimson Lotus, and I'll let you know. (It might be good to clarify that Rai is in his early 20's)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is there someone you despise more than anyone else? If so, why? </div> </div> </div>The Walker in Darkness, not only does his Ideology offend me, but something about him disturbs me to the very core of my soul.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you truly loyal to someone or something? If so, why does this person, thing or idea command your trust? </div> </div> </div>The Idea that everyone deserves a second chance, as it is the only thing that gets me out of bed in the morning. I don't do third chances, however.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What are you <i>really</i> afraid of? </div> </div> </div>Myself. Making the same mistakes I made in the past.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you knew for a fact that a complete stranger would die unless you sacrificed yourself to save them, would you do it? Keep in mind, you have no idea who this person is, what they have done up to now, what they would do with the life they're given, or how long they have to live in any event. </div> </div> </div>Yes. though with my luck it wouldn't end well.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T00:23:15-07:00","id":620960,"title":"","content":"You say that the ideology of the Walker in Darkness offends you. Would you care to explain that in further details from your point of view? Do you know what the ideology of the Walker in Darkness is or are you going off of assumptions?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T01:56:32-07:00","id":621005,"title":"","content":"How did you develop your working vocabulary about supernatural beings? Solar, Zenith, Dusk, etc.?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5706-zeal","name":"Zeal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T06:45:32-07:00","id":621189,"title":"","content":"Do you know the names of your Charms, or do you make up nicknames for them? Or are they simply 'things you can do'?<br /> <br /> Given the the near-ubitquitousness of the Immaculate Faith/Philosophy, most people panic when they see a gold anima. How much do you try to hide your Solarness?<br /> -Are you one of those Solars that glows gold near-constantly, trying to drum up old world values of Solar righeousness and dominion? Or do you hide the ever-loving crap out of your status?<br /> <br /> What kinds of Exalts have you seen so far? Do you have a preference or dislike for a particular set of Chosen, or is it all about the individual?<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">Which do you think has more value: a man's kingdom, his principles, his honor, his loved ones, or his life? Which would you trade first?</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T06:53:51-07:00","id":621194,"title":"","content":"Tell us about the vision given by the Unconquered Sun when you Exalted. Was it a very concrete conversation or an abstract moment of connection? Metaphorical? Like a hallucination?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T07:26:16-07:00","id":621236,"title":"","content":"What's your stance on demon summoning? Do you find it preferable to using elementals? Or the dead?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T09:35:10-07:00","id":621409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jutlander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=620960#post620960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You say that the ideology of the Walker in Darkness offends you. Would you care to explain that in further details from your point of view? Do you know what the ideology of the Walker in Darkness is or are you going off of assumptions?</div> </div> </div> </div>And when I exalted, I had a moment of extreme clarity in which saw the beauty of what the world was, what it is now, and most importantly what it could be. From what I've heard from the servants of the Walker i have encountered, his goal appears to be the destruction of that world, though I may be grasping at straws here. You'll understand if I'm not too keen on that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeal</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">How did you develop your working vocabulary about supernatural beings? Solar, Zenith, Dusk, etc.?</div> </div> </div> </div>Shara, The leader of our circle is about 250 years old, her mentor was even older. Their knowledge of that got passed down to us in turn. For the Abyssal caste names we simply found opposites to the Solar names.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brasstreader</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you know the names of your Charms, or do you make up nicknames for them? Or are they simply 'things you can do'?</div> </div> </div> </div>My what? I suppose it's the latter, though I do get the urge to shout &quot;HEAVEN THUNDER HAMMER&quot; every time I punch someone across a room.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Given the the near-ubitquitousness of the Immaculate Faith/Philosophy, most people panic when they see a gold anima. How much do you try to hide your Solarness? </div> </div> </div>I hide it most when I deal with Realm Satraps or Lookshy. I play it a bit looser elsewhere if I need to. the goal is to become powerful enough before it gets widely public such that when it does, Killing me would be inconvenient.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> -Are you one of those Solars that glows gold near-constantly, trying to drum up old world values of Solar righteousness and dominion? Or do you hide the ever-loving crap out of your status? </div> </div> </div>As above, it kind of varies. when I want to drum up old world values, I'm not afraid to flare. But since I'm still to close to the Realm and Lookshy for comfort, I mostly hide it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What kinds of Exalts have you seen so far? Do you have a preference or dislike for a particular set of Chosen, or is it all about the individual? </div> </div> </div>Lunars, Abyssals, Sidereals and say one or two Dragonbloods. I largely judge on an individual basis, as I've met good and bad people among all of the above.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#008000\">Which do you think has more value: a man's kingdom, his principles, his honor, his loved ones, or his life? Which would you trade first?</span> </div> </div> </div>Hmm... I... genuinely don't know. the only thing I can say is that my honor is nothing compared to the safety of my people.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tell us about the vision given by the Unconquered Sun when you Exalted. Was it a very concrete conversation or an abstract moment of connection? Metaphorical? Like a hallucination?</div> </div> </div> </div>A bit of both, the whole thing feels like it was a hallucination, but the words of the Unconquered Sun still ring through my head. The Idea that we both made mistakes in the past, but now was the time to begin making up for them. The call to take light into the darkness, and make the world righteous as i saw fit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T09:38:37-07:00","id":621412,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryphon's Feather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=621236#post621236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's your stance on demon summoning? Do you find it preferable to using elementals? Or the dead?</div> </div> </div> </div>If a demon is what we need, I see no problem using them, though I'd prefer using elementals given the choice. Summoning the dead is only for extreme cases.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-14T15:07:48-07:00","id":627009,"title":"","content":"Defeating a Deathlord seems like fairly lofty goal, even for one of the Chosen. What strides have you made in this direction? I mean, if you intend to try and ally with the Realm in some fashion, you are going to have to show that the Deathlords are a much bigger threat to the security of the Realm than you and your circle are and you are going to need to show them you have the mojo to pull it off. Isnt that a bit intimidating?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/779-nusoardgraphite","name":"NuSoardGraphite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar779_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-14T21:20:58-07:00","id":627223,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NuSoardGraphite</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=627009#post627009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Defeating a Deathlord seems like fairly lofty goal, even for one of the Chosen. What strides have you made in this direction? I mean, if you intend to try and ally with the Realm in some fashion, you are going to have to show that the Deathlords are a much bigger threat to the security of the Realm than you and your circle are and you are going to need to show them you have the mojo to pull it off. Isnt that a bit intimidating?</div> </div> </div> </div>Intimidating is an understatement. We're trying to pull together allies throughout the Scavenger Lands. I've started a mercenary band called the Grey Eagle Company and taken strides to pull in refugees from settlements that have been attacked by the Walker's forces. I've managed to forge these victims into an elite fighting force and one of the largest mercenary companies in the area alongside the Bronze Tigers. I intend to meet with Dace, the leader of the Bronze Tigers, to discuss the possibility of cooperating together on this. The others are working various angles, Lotus and Skylas are spying on the walker and warning various settlements they find are targets. Corty is attempting to recruit allies for us outside the scavenger lands. Shara, gods only know why, is trying to track down an Abyssal warrior she'd heard about who may be able to help.<br /> <br /> A lot of this is to show that we have enough power to be taken seriously, and to turn the eyes of the world to the enemies at our gates. If we can get Lookshy to mobilize, I'll call it a win. If the Realm decides to rear it's head, then the enemies of Creation should be very afraid, I know I will be, should that come to pass. And while we avoid discussing the possibility with the Lunars, Skylas and I hope we may turn Heaven's eye toward the Deathlords, as that kind of help would be invaluable to our efforts.<br /> <br /> Pulling this off is gonna be a Bitch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-14T22:56:53-07:00","id":627288,"title":"","content":"Do you hold anything of the Immaculate faith's morality to be noble in of itself? I understand not putting faith in the whole Solars-bad, Dragon bloods - awesome, but the basic ideals of compassion and giving mortals hope in doing good deeds will lead to a greater reward.<br /> <br /> Do you associate more with the idea that Exalts exist to protect and inspire mortals or that mortals should obey exalted rulers above all things? <br /> <br /> If you had the chance to defeat the Walker in the Darkness in an instant, but could release something terrifying and dangerous to Creation, like a Primordial, a Yozi or a Shinma, would you take the risk?<br /> <br /> And Finally, the deepest and most important question of all, what sort of shinies (artefacts) do you possess, if any?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://jaxushomebrew.blogspot.ie/2016/06/introduction-site-map-and-catalogue.html\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew blog</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1291-mr-jaxus","name":"Mr.Jaxus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"379"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-15T16:28:42-07:00","id":628108,"title":"","content":"Have you ever heard of something called an &quot;Infernal Exalted&quot; or &quot;Green Sun Prince?&quot; If not, what images or ideas do those names inspire in you?<br /> <br /> If you have, would you accept the aid of such a being against the Walker?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-15T21:02:41-07:00","id":628196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.Jaxus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=627288#post627288\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you hold anything of the Immaculate faith's morality to be noble in of itself? I understand not putting faith in the whole Solars-bad, Dragon bloods - awesome, but the basic ideals of compassion and giving mortals hope in doing good deeds will lead to a greater reward.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do believe that the Immaculate Order has the right of it on living a good life, doing right by others so that others will do right by you. I just believe the call to live a righteous life should include everyone, mortal or Exalt.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you associate more with the idea that Exalts exist to protect and inspire mortals or that mortals should obey exalted rulers above all things? </div> </div> </div>I believe our purpose is to inspire mortals. We show them that the dark is less fearsome than they thought, that the monsters can be beaten, and that the sun always rises after the long night.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you had the chance to defeat the Walker in the Darkness in an instant, but could release something terrifying and dangerous to Creation, like a Primordial, a Yozi or a Shinma, would you take the risk? </div> </div> </div>If my defeating one threat to Creation releases something even more threatening, I'm doing it wrong.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And Finally, the deepest and most important question of all, what sort of shinies (artefacts) do you possess, if any? </div> </div> </div>I possess two. The orichalcum daiklave used to kill my first age incarnation, which is tainted by betrayal. It occasionally urges me to assault people that depend about me when I use it. I intend to change it's nature by using it for a more noble purpose. The other artifact is a buff jacket made of moonsilver and starmetal, wrapped in the skin of a behemoth. I can it's change color and shape at will, so long as it remains roughly an overcoat. It even changes subtly on it's own based on the situation I'm in, such as the collar growing higher when I threaten people, or taking on a more military appearance with my troops.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-15T21:11:23-07:00","id":628198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=628108#post628108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have you ever heard of something called an &quot;Infernal Exalted&quot; or &quot;Green Sun Prince?&quot; If not, what images or ideas do those names inspire in you?\\\\<br /> <br /> If you have, would you accept the aid of such a being against the Walker?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have not, and with names like that I'm not sure I'd relish the experience. It brings to mind, somewhat ironically, the Immaculate description of &quot;anathema&quot; the demons that they say we the Solars are, and undoubtedly were in the past.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T09:54:04-07:00","id":629993,"title":"","content":"While I am sure that you do not believe yourself an Anathema (and perhaps you are not, but as you claim, a real Chosen of the Sun), do you believe that there are such individuals? Demons dressed as men, or persons whose illicit grasping at the King of The Gods' perfection will drive them insane?<br /> <br /> How would you distinguish such 'Anathema' from persons such as yourself, and would you aid those who hunt them to show your own true righteousness? For I have heard of one, who calls himself a 'Night Caste', who sits in judgement of his fellows. Those who can prove their devotion to Creation as genuine, he aids, and those whom he deems unfit, he calls Anathema, and sets the Wyld Hunt to them.<br /> <br /> And he is coming.... here..... (falls down dead from an arrow to the back of his head)<br /> -a former peasant, sent as a warning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T20:24:25-07:00","id":630595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brasstreader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=629993#post629993\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I am sure that you do not believe yourself an Anathema (and perhaps you are not, but as you claim, a real Chosen of the Sun), do you believe that there are such individuals? Demons dressed as men, or persons whose illicit grasping at the King of The Gods' perfection will drive them insane?<br /> <br /> How would you distinguish such 'Anathema' from persons such as yourself, and would you aid those who hunt them to show your own true righteousness? For I have heard of one, who calls himself a 'Night Caste', who sits in judgement of his fellows. Those who can prove their devotion to Creation as genuine, he aids, and those whom he deems unfit, he calls Anathema, and sets the Wyld Hunt to them.<br /> <br /> And he is coming.... here..... (falls down dead from an arrow to the back of his head)<br /> -a former peasant, sent as a warning.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> (Sets the body aflame via Zenith Anima) I believe there are true Anathema. Evil people whose great deed gains the attention of the Unconquered Sun, virtuous souls corrupted by power, there is nothing stopping any of us from diving off the slippery slope into madness. I understand that to achieve their goals many must pit good men against other good men, and I have accepted this. I will shed blood to reach my goals, but I will not shed it needlessly. Wanton slaughter and cruelty, a total disregard for the sanctity human life, that is the mark of a true Anathema, and I will stand against that as best I am able.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-19T06:39:43-07:00","id":632205,"title":"","content":"When you say you find it hard to worship the Unconquered Sun because you could meet him, what do you mean? <br /> <br /> All of the gods can be met and so can the Dragons in certain sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2325-builder","name":"Builder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-19T08:47:22-07:00","id":632347,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Builder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=632205#post632205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When you say you find it hard to worship the Unconquered Sun because you could meet him, what do you mean?<br /> <br /> All of the gods can be met and so can the Dragons in certain sense.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> And so can the Dragonblooded who, according to the religion I was born under, are the ones I'm supposed to be worshiping. I find it hard to worship anything I could meet now because I've met so many of my 'spiritual superiors' who I'd originally known simply as 'brother', 'sister', 'cousin', 'father', etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-19T11:28:25-07:00","id":632556,"title":"","content":"The Dragons are to be emulated, not worshipped! They are not idols, and neither are we, their Chosen! Clearly your family's heresy led you to this accursed state of being.<br /> <br /> Worry not! I'll reward their heresy in due time (with a rain of fists), and then tear the wicked spirit out of your poor unfortunate bones.<br /> <br /> Until then: do you have any worshippers, Anathema, or a proper cult to your name?<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">\u2013 Monk O, Immaculate zealot</div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-19T16:31:00-07:00","id":632820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=632556#post632556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Dragons are to be emulated, not worshipped! They are not idols, and neither are we, their Chosen! Clearly your family's heresy led you to this accursed state of being.<br /> <br /> Worry not! I'll reward their heresy in due time (with a rain of fists), and then tear the wicked spirit out of your poor unfortunate bones.<br /> <br /> Until then: do you have any worshippers, Anathema, or a proper cult to your name?<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">\u2013 Monk O, Immaculate zealot</div></div> </div> </div> </div>That... is definitely not what I had learned... perhaps the Immaculates have more sense than I gave them credit for. My family has already met their doom however, so I have denied your heretic hunt.<br /> <br /> To answer your question, no I do not have a cult. I have followers in the form of my mercenary company, but I discourage the formation of a cult in my name. It would be hypocritical of me to encourage people to worship me when I refuse to worship anyone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T01:27:47-07:00","id":633286,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Marros56</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=632347#post632347\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> And so can the Dragonblooded who, according to the religion I was born under, are the ones I'm supposed to be worshiping. I find it hard to worship anything I could meet now because I've met so many of my 'spiritual superiors' who I'd originally known simply as 'brother', 'sister', 'cousin', 'father', etc.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So because of the failings of the DB you transfer that to the Uncounquered Sun?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2325-builder","name":"Builder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T11:13:34-07:00","id":633599,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Builder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/620803-interview-with-a-solar?p=633286#post633286\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> So because of the failings of the DB you transfer that to the Uncounquered Sun?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm... That is wholly unfair, isn't it? To write off my own patron because of the failures of my family. I'm projecting my issues with the DBs treatment of mortals on the UCS, and all other gods for that matter...<br /> <br /> I have a lot to think about. /FaithCrisis","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}